# Search result highlighting

Every search input that renders a result list marks the matched characters in each result.

- Ant Design selects that can be searched use `SearchSelect` from `@/shared/ui`. It highlights each option label from the current search text.
- Custom option content and other result lists wrap the visible text with `HighlightMatch` from `@/shared/ui`.
- Matching is case-insensitive. Each word of at least 2 characters is marked. Overlapping words merge into one mark.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — searchable select with plain option text
<Select showSearch options={options} />

// ✅ GOOD
<SearchSelect options={options} />

// ✅ GOOD — custom result row
<HighlightMatch query={query} text={hit.title} />
```
